     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap map-diagnostic-report-diabetes</b></p><a name=\"map-diagnostic-report-diabetes\"> </a><a name=\"hcmap-diagnostic-report-diabetes\"> </a><p>Mapping from <a href=\"StructureDefinition-BeModelDiagnosticReportDiabetes.html\">BeModelDiagnosticReportDiabetes</a> to <a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-diagnostic-report-diabetes.html\">BeDiagnosticReportDiabetes</a></p><br/><p>Mapping from <a href=\"StructureDefinition-BeModelDiagnosticReportDiabetes.html\">BeModelDiagnosticReportDiabetes</a> to <a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-diagnostic-report-diabetes.html\">BeDiagnosticReportDiabetes</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">UniqueIdentifierNational</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-diagnostic-report-diabetes.html#s-DiagnosticReport.identifier:UUID\">DiagnosticReport.identifier:UUID</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>System fixed to be-ns-diagnostic-report-diabetes.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">BusinessIdentifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-diagnostic-report-diabetes.html#s-DiagnosticReport.identifier\">DiagnosticReport.identifier</a></td><td>1..*</td><td>todo</td><td>Additional identifier with the supplier's own system (identifier slicing is open).</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">RecordedDate</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-diagnostic-report-diabetes.html#s-DiagnosticReport.extension:recorded-date\">DiagnosticReport.extension:recorded-date</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">ObservationPeriod</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">DiagnosticReport.effectivePeriod</td><td>effective[x] is restricted to Period; start and end are both mandatory.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Patient</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-diagnostic-report-diabetes.html#s-DiagnosticReport.subject\">DiagnosticReport.subject</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>The model carries the NISS; in FHIR it is the identifier of the referenced patient (or Reference.identifier). Unlike the observation profile, subject is not restricted to BePatient.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Recorder</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-diagnostic-report-diabetes.html#s-DiagnosticReport.extension:recorder\">DiagnosticReport.extension:recorder</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>The model carries the NISS of the professional or the company number of the organization; in FHIR this is a reference to the corresponding practitioner, practitioner role or organization.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Performer</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-diagnostic-report-diabetes.html#s-DiagnosticReport.performer\">DiagnosticReport.performer</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td>Not constrained in the profile. For the diabetes report, performer = recorder.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Interpreter</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-diagnostic-report-diabetes.html#s-DiagnosticReport.resultsInterpreter\">DiagnosticReport.resultsInterpreter</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Reference(BePractitionerRole | BePractitioner). Not provided by the report producer; added by the interpreting care provider.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Category</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-diagnostic-report-diabetes.html#s-DiagnosticReport.category\">DiagnosticReport.category</a></td><td>1..*</td><td>todo</td><td>Bound to BeVSDiabetesReportCategory.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Qualification</td><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">No element in the profile carries the diabetes category. It is calculated from the diagnosis by the interpreting doctor (default CAT 3) and is also used in Observation.referenceRange.appliesTo.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Device</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">DiagnosticReport.extension:device.extension:concept.valueCodeableConcept</td><td>The INAMI sensor type number is sent as a code with system be-ns-diabetes-device-type.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Code</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-diagnostic-report-diabetes.html#s-DiagnosticReport.code\">DiagnosticReport.code</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Bound to BeVSDiabetesReportCode (e.g. 439926003 Ambulatory continuous glucose monitoring of interstitial tissue fluid).</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">DerivedObservations</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-diagnostic-report-diabetes.html#s-DiagnosticReport.result\">DiagnosticReport.result</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td>Reference(BeObservationDiabetes).</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">MeasurementObservations</td><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">No element in the profile. DiagnosticReport.result is restricted to BeObservationDiabetes (derived values), so the individual measurements are not referenced from the report.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Diagnosis</td><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">No element in the R4 profile. The R5 DiagnosticReport.supportingInfo cross-version extension was considered but is commented out in the profile.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Note</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-diagnostic-report-diabetes.html#s-DiagnosticReport.extension:note\">DiagnosticReport.extension:note</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td>Not provided by the report producer; added by the interpreting care provider.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Document</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-diagnostic-report-diabetes.html#s-DiagnosticReport.presentedForm\">DiagnosticReport.presentedForm</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td>contentType fixed to application/pdf.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Status</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equi